data/da/

# Notebook artifacts, not the notebooks themselves. The data snapshot
# under here is a copy of the private forecast/observation archive, and
# the trained model files are regenerated by notebook 03; model files are
# committed individually when a deployment needs them. The notebooks are
# committed with their outputs, which carry aggregate statistics only.
notebooks/artifacts/
notebooks/__pycache__/
